Z||000004||MinnGreenGT||12-13-2001||03:40 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula88:<BR><B><BR>4. Know more than 10 ways to order a cup of coffee.<BR>8. Know the exact location of fifteen drive-thru espresso stands in your<BR>neighborhood.<BR>12. Can taste the difference between Starbucks, Seattle's Best Coffee, and<BR>Veneto's.<BR>17. In the winter, go to work in the dark, come home in the dark, and only<BR>have an 8 hour day.<BR>18. Understand what people mean when they say "pop." (Translation: soda)<BR>20. Know what lutefisk is.<BR>31. Ever ordered a half caff/decaf, nonfat mocha Grande with raspberry whip<BR>(or know what it is).<BR>32. Attended a wedding where the bride and groom registered at REI.<BR>33. Are amazed at an accurate weather forecast.<BR>35. Put on your shorts when the temperature gets above 50, but still wear<BR>your hiking boots and parka.<BR>36. Switch to your sandals when it gets above 60, but keep the socks on.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Some of these could easily be Minnesotan too!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> And more if you're a "coffee person" here...<P>Good list!<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
